Z||000001||FieroLisa||02-22-2001||09:50 PM||||I've had these for a while, not too sure if they are 100% correct.<P>FIERO PERFORMANCE STATS <P>Year...Model...Engine......0-60...1/4 Mile <P>1984.....SE.....2.5L I4......10.9..18.1@74 <BR>1984..pacecar..2.7L I4......6.3...14.7@93 <BR>1985....2M6....2.8L V6......6.9...15.2@90 <BR>1886.....GT.....2.8L V6......7.1...15.0@91 <BR>1988..formula..2.8L V6......6.9...15.4@89 <BR>1988.....GT.....2.8L V6......7.8...16.0@85 <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Lisa<BR>86 gold 4 speed GT<BR>AOL IM: FieroLisa<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/" TARGET=_blank>FieroLisa's Website</A><BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/ncfieros/" TARGET=_blank>Tarheels Fieros Website</A><BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pffsig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
