Z||000008||Slammed Fiero||02-23-2001||11:01 PM||||I have run 6.54 to 60 in my car with FieroLisa as a witness , using a GTEC. I also pulled off a few 6.6 sec runs @ home in kingston using another GTEC<P>I don't have ANY real engine mods, coil , no cat , cold air induction short shift , 4spd 3.65 tranny , near stock height tires , stock ignition wires , 40,000 miles.<P>It can be done , but you have to beat on the car. <P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jonathan M McCreery<BR>86 GT<BR>New Custom White face gauges 17" Tr motorsports Typhoons Ground Control coil overs , Big bars front and rear , Mustang scoop , accel coil , no cat , 4spd , short shift , poly dog bone and bushings momo pedals and shift knob , round headlight conversion , Geni stainless steel oval exhaust tips. Pioneer 6000 CD player , Sony Mobile Amp. Currently doing big brake conversion...<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/jssig.jpg"> ||||reg||1
